A/Pages/discover-saudi-arabia/para-en.jpg\">\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"saudia-h3-spacing\">\neVisa&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.saudia.com/pages/-/media/Project/SA/SC/SAUDIA/Pages/discover-saudi-arabia/visa.png\">\n</h2>\n<p>\nThe eVisa is the new portal to the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia for the world. <br>\nIssuing an eVisa is an easy and fast procedure for any Guest from the eligible countries.\n</p>\n<div>\n<a href=\"/en-SA/explore/visit-saudi-arabia/visas\" class=\"saudia-btn saudia-btn--primary\">Learn more</a>\n</div>\n</div></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-tabs class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-tab-container\"><mat-tab-group animationduration=\"0ms\" class=\"mat-tab-group mat-primary ng-star-inserted\"><mat-tab-header class=\"mat-tab-header\"><button aria-hidden=\"false\" type=\"button\" mat-ripple=\"\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-header-pagination mat-tab-header-pagination-before mat-elevation-z4 mat-tab-header-pagination-disabled\" disabled=\"\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Previous slide\"><div class=\"mat-tab-header-pagination-chevron\"></div></button><div class=\"mat-tab-label-container\"><div role=\"tablist\" class=\"mat-tab-list\"><div class=\"mat-tab-labels\"><div role=\"tab\" mattablabelwrapper=\"\" mat-ripple=\"\" cdkmonitorelementfocus=\"\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-label mat-focus-indicator mat-tab-label-active ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-label-1-0\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-posinset=\"1\" aria-setsize=\"2\" aria-controls=\"mat-tab-content-1-0\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><div class=\"mat-tab-label-content\">UNESCO sites<!----><!----><!----></div></div><div role=\"tab\" mattablabelwrapper=\"\" mat-ripple=\"\" cdkmonitorelementfocus=\"\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-label mat-focus-indicator ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-label-1-1\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-posinset=\"2\" aria-setsize=\"2\" aria-controls=\"mat-tab-content-1-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><div class=\"mat-tab-label-content\">Famous local cuisine<!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----></div><mat-ink-bar class=\"mat-ink-bar\"></mat-ink-bar></div></div><button aria-hidden=\"false\" type=\"button\" mat-ripple=\"\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-header-pagination mat-tab-header-pagination-after mat-elevation-z4 mat-tab-header-pagination-disabled\" disabled=\"\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Next slide\"><div class=\"mat-tab-header-pagination-chevron\"></div></button></mat-tab-header><div class=\"mat-tab-body-wrapper\"><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-25 mat-tab-body-active ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-1-0\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-1-0\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-25 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----><div class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">\n\n<div class=\"saudia-unesco-section\">\n  <h2 class=\"text-center\">UNESCO sites</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"saudia-heritage-grid\">\n    \n    <div class=\"saudia-heritage-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://www.saudia.com/-/media/Project/SA/SC/SAUDIA/Pages/discover-saudi-arabia/alula-en.png\" alt=\"Hegra - Mada’in Saleh archaeological site\" class=\"saudia-heritage-img\">\n      <h3 class=\"saudia-heritage-title saudia-h3-spacing\">Mada’in Saleh</h3>\n      <p>The first world heritage site in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia and the largest archaeological site of the Nabataean civilization. It contains more than 50 inscriptions from the pre-Nabataean era and 111 archaeological tombs.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"saudia-heritage-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://www.saudia.com/-/media/Project/SA/SC/SAUDIA/Pages/discover-saudi-arabia/jeddah-en.png\" alt=\"Historic Jeddah Al-Balad architecture\" class=\"saudia-heritage-img\">\n      <h3 class=\"saudia-heritage-title saudia-h3-spacing\">Historic Jeddah</h3>\n      <p>This culturally diverse neighborhood on the Red Sea coast served as a major harbor for ancient trade routes. It remains a historical gateway for pilgrims traveling by sea to Mecca.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"saudia-heritage-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://www.saudia.com/-/media/Project/SA/SC/SAUDIA/Pages/discover-saudi-arabia/AdDiriyah-en.png\" alt=\"At-Turaif District in Diriyah\" class=\"saudia-heritage-img\">\n      <h3 class=\"saudia-heritage-title saudia-h3-spacing\">At-Turaif District</h3>\n      <p>The first capital of the Al Saud family, dating back to the 15th century. It is a living museum documenting the traditional Najdi lifestyle and the first Saudi state.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"saudia-heritage-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://www.saudia.com/-/media/Project/SA/SC/SAUDIA/Pages/discover-saudi-arabia/hail-en.png\" alt=\"Rock Art in the Ha’il Region\" class=\"saudia-heritage-img\">\n      <h3 class=\"saudia-heritage-title saudia-h3-spacing\">Rock Art</h3>\n      <p>Documenting a civilization that lived for 10,000 years, this site in the Ha’il region features ancient petroglyphs located between two great mountain ranges.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"saudia-heritage-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://www.saudia.com/-/media/Project/SA/SC/SAUDIA/Pages/discover-saudi-arabia/alhasa-en.png\" alt=\"Al-Ahsa Oasis palm groves\" class=\"saudia-heritage-img\">\n      <h3 class=\"saudia-heritage-title saudia-h3-spacing\">Al-Ahsa Oasis</h3>\n      <p>A green paradise across 20,000 hectares featuring 2.5 million palm trees, historic gardens, and wells that reflect the region's ancient agricultural mastery.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"saudia-heritage-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://www.saudia.com/-/media/Project/SA/SC/SAUDIA/Pages/discover-saudi-arabia/najran-en.png\" alt=\"Hima Cultural Area rock inscriptions\" class=\"saudia-heritage-img\">\n      <h3 class=\"saudia-heritage-title saudia-h3-spacing\">Bir Hima Rock</h3>\n      <p>Located near Najran, Bir Hima contains petroglyphs dating back 7,000 years. It is a historic treasure documenting ancient travelers' routes across the Arabian Peninsula.</p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div></span><!----></p><!----></div><!----></div></mat-tab-body><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-26 ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-1-1\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-1-1\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-26 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----></div></mat-tab-body><!----></div></mat-tab-group><!----></div></app-jss-tabs><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\">\n\n<div class=\"dsa-campaign-footer\">\n  \n  <div class=\"dsa-campaign-banner-wrap\">\n    <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.visitsaudi.com/en\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Visit Saudi Arabia - External link\">\n      <img alt=\"Discover Saudi Arabia - Visit Saudi\" class=\"dsa-campaign-banner-img\" src=\"https://www.saudia.com/-/media/Project/SA/SC/SAUDIA/Pages/discover-saudi-arabia/discover-saudi-bottom-en-2.png?h=124&amp;w=1087&amp;rev=9e5a7f0791554d6a973d2e86b03fc542&amp;hash=6EA0C3480B4F51CDE4C5FA20DEDF77AB\">\n    </a>\n  </div>\n  \n  <div class=\"dsa-campaign-actions\">\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"saudia-btn-bottom saudia-btn-bottom--secondary\">Book your ticket</a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.saudia.com/holidays/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Holidays by Saudia\" class=\"saudia-btn-bottom saudia-btn-bottom--secondary\">Book your packages</a>\n    <a href=\"/en-SA/plan/before-you-fly/travel-requirements\" class=\"saudia-btn-bottom saudia-btn-bottom--secondary\">Travel requirements</a>\n  </div>\n\n</div></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-space class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-spacer-component\"></div></app-jss-space><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-saudia-general-tablayout class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"booking ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"custom-overlay ng-star-inserted\"></div><!----><mat-tab-group mat-align-tabs=\"start\" animationduration=\"0ms\" class=\"mat-tab-group booking-content mat-primary\"><mat-tab-header class=\"mat-tab-header\"><button aria-hidden=\"false\" type=\"button\" mat-ripple=\"\" tabindex